#: src/FacetedBrowse/FacetType/DateInInterval.php:69
msgid ""
"Enter one value per line: a single date/time in ISO 8601 format, a space, "
"then the human-readable date/time. For example \"1935-06-15 15 June 1935\". "
"Date ranges are not accepted. A partial date means its first moment, so "
"\"1930\" is 1 January 1930."
msgstr ""

