#: src/FacetedBrowse/FacetType/DateAfter.php:69
#: src/FacetedBrowse/FacetType/DateBefore.php:69
msgid ""
"Enter the date/time values, separated by a new line. For each line, enter "
"the date/time in ISO 8601 format, followed by a space, followed by the "
"human-readable date/time."
msgstr ""
"Introduïu els valors de data/hora, separats per una línia nova. Per a cada "
"línia, introduïu la data/hora en el format ISO 8601, seguit d'un espai i "
"seguit de la data/hora llegible per humans."

