#: src/Datavis/DatasetType/CountItemsPropertyValuesTimeSeries.php:81
#: src/Datavis/DatasetType/CountItemsTimeSeries.php:55
msgid ""
"Enter the start of the time series in ISO 8601 format: YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS"
msgstr "Introduïu la data inicial en format ISO 8601: YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS"

#: src/Datavis/DatasetType/CountItemsPropertyValuesTimeSeries.php:95
#: src/Datavis/DatasetType/CountItemsTimeSeries.php:69
msgid ""
"Enter the end of the time series in full ISO 8601 format: <code>YYYY-MM-"
"DDTHH:MM:SS</code>. This is an exclusive upper bound — to include all items "
"through the year 1900, enter <code>1901-01-01T00:00:00</code>."
msgstr ""
"Introduïu el final de la sèrie temporal en format ISO 8601 complet: "
"<code>YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS</code>. Es tracta d'un límit superior exclusiu — "
"Per incloure tots els elements fins a l'any 1900 inclòs, introduïu "
"<code>1901-01-01T00:00:00</code>."

